node_modules
dist
# TypeScript's incremental cache. Left in the build context it tells tsc that
# everything is already compiled, while deleteOutDir has just emptied dist — so
# the image builds "successfully" with no dist/main.js in it. It is git-ignored,
# which is why a fresh CI checkout never hit this and a local build always did.
